# Keep the build context small and deterministic. `build/` alone is ~2 GB of
# host artifacts that would be copied in and then ignored by the container
# build — and a host-built binary landing in the image is exactly how a
# sanitizer build reaches production by accident.
build/
results/
docs/
fuzz/
web/
.git/
.github/
*.md
*.ppm
assets/
